---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageLead from "../components/PageLead.astro";
import ArrowIcon from "../components/ArrowIcon.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="AnalyseSpider log analysis successor"
  description="A new, browser-local successor to the historical AnalyseSpider log-analysis intent."
  canonicalPath="/analysespider.html"
>
  <PageLead title="Log analysis, rebuilt from first principles." intro="This historical path now leads to a new browser-local log inspector. It does not host or recreate the former AnalyseSpider software." />
  <section class="content-grid">
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>A truthful successor</h2>
      <p>Historical snapshots and live referring pages show that this URL was associated with web-log analysis, crawler visits, response patterns, downloads, and geographic reporting. That evidence supports the user job—not rights to the former implementation.</p>
      <p>The current Log File Inspector independently parses bounded Apache and Nginx samples inside your browser. It reports request counts, crawler signatures, status groups, and top paths. Nothing is uploaded by the current tool.</p>
      <a class="button primary" href="/tools/log-file-inspector">Open the new log inspector <ArrowIcon /></a>
      <h2>Not the former product</h2>
      <p>No former executable, source code, database, account, customer relationship, screenshot, documentation, warranty, or operator identity transferred with this domain.</p>
    </article>
    <aside class="side-note">
      <h3>Path decision</h3>
      <dl class="facts-list">
        <div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Restore 200</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Referring domains</dt><dd>25 in paid target report</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Current implementation</dt><dd>New browser-local parser</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Former software</dt><dd>Not available</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
